# Approved matches for scripts/scan-personal-data.py. Keep this file small.
# Tab-separated: path, pattern, most matches allowed per file version (or *), reason.
# Never put the matched value here. The paths metadata:commit-author and
# metadata:commit-message mean commit metadata.
metadata:commit-author	identity-name	*	the owner's name as commit author
scripts/build-release.sh	identity-name	1	the public repository URL required in release source notices
README.md	identity-name	1	the public repository clone URL
scripts/install.sh	identity-name	1	the public repository release URL
docs/install.md	identity-name	1	the public repository release URL
.audit/build.tsv	identity-name	5	public repository and merged pull request URLs in the build log
crates/hx-interpret/src/snapshots/hx_interpret__digest__tests__mac_only_digest_main.snap	captured-prose	2	fixed renderer format and citation instructions; sample observations and screen text are synthetic
docs/BUILD-BRIEF.md	identity-name	1	the public repository URL
